## Important Rules

- Preserve old names as aliases.
- Do not delete any files.
- Do not merge non-empty notes automatically.
- Do not update Canvas until registry is clean.
- [[SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3]] is the consolidated sourcing project.
- [[FD.Datamart.v2.2]] and [[CPD.Datamart.v1.1]] are separate projects.
- [[MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1]] is MER-led unless evidence proves otherwise.
